# Real, per-song ordered token sequences used to train the riff model --
# close enough to the source songs' actual melodic content (a real
# transcription, not just aggregate statistics) that it must stay
# local-only, same posture as reference/ and the raw audio itself.
engine/data/ml_corpus/
# Trained model weights -- derived from the same real, non-redistributable
# transcribed data above, kept local-only for the same reason.
engine/models/
*.pt
*.pth

# Real, per-fragment semitone-delta/duration/role data extracted verbatim
# from real Guitar Pro tabs (riff_bank.py) -- more directly the source
# songs' own melodic content than even ml_corpus/ above, so it gets at
# least the same local-only posture. The raw source tab files themselves
# already fall under the blanket reference/ ignore above.
engine/data/riff_bank.json
